Use the installed original font without changing libtcod 1.5.1's defaults.

The original game relies on terminal.png in the working directory.  Select
its absolute installed path before console initialization, retaining ASCII
column order, 16 by 16 characters, and neither greyscale nor TCOD layout.
All gameplay, random generation, console dimensions and timing are unchanged.

